From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:35:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] setupapi: class images and icons, SetupPromptReboot,
 destroy-private-data for removed devices

SetupDiGetClassImageList(Ex), SetupDiGetClassImageIndex, SetupDiDestroyClassImageList,
SetupDiLoadClassIcon, SetupDiGetClassBitmapIndex and SetupDiDrawMiniIcon work over a
list with one small icon per registered class (class IconPath/Icon, else a generic
icon). SetupPromptReboot reports files replaced at next boot by a committed queue
(SPFILEQ_*), prompts unless scan-only. SetupDiCallClassInstaller still delivers
DIF_DESTROYPRIVATEDATA to co-installers for a device that was removed (devinst
test todo_wine removed).

